      "writtenOn": "2024-07-08T19:39:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ideally the dawn.json would specify complex return types semantically and each language (including C) would adapt it as required. The problem is that I have no other choice but to reinterpret C idiom dawn.json signatures on the fly.",
