        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-09T08:56:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For some things like callback that seems to be present many times that can make sense, but there\u0027s a number of more bespoke functions. Inventing a semantic for each of them individually is not practical, only when there starts to be a bunch of them does the complexity of adding a semantic make sense. Otherwise a semantic is just a more complex way to just do manually written code.",
      "parentUuid": "d2dc6bce_8315b392",
      "revId": "67d29ffb786fd405754eb01fb553a37b32ff39bf",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
